---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SEO from '../components/SEO.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <SEO
      title="Terms of Use - WhatsDiscount"
      description="Read the WhatsDiscount Terms of Use to understand the rules and conditions for using our website and services."
    />
  </Fragment>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 md:py-12">
    <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: May 2026</p>
    
    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-6">
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        By accessing and using WhatsDiscount (whatsdiscount.co.uk), you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms of Use. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Use of the Website</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        WhatsDiscount provides voucher codes and promotional deals from various retailers. We do not guarantee that all codes will be valid or applicable to your purchase. Codes are provided for informational purposes and should be verified at the retailer's website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        We may earn a commission when you click on links to retailer websites and make a purchase. This does not affect the price you pay. Our affiliate relationships help us maintain the website and continue providing free voucher codes to our users.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Accuracy of Information</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        While we strive to keep our voucher codes and store information up to date, we cannot guarantee the accuracy, completeness, or timeliness of all content. Retailers may change their offers without notice.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        The content on this website, excluding retailer logos and trademarks, is owned by WhatsDiscount. Retailer logos and trademarks are the property of their respective owners and are used here for identification purposes only.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        WhatsDiscount shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of our website or the inability to use voucher codes found on our platform.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Use at any time. Continued use of the website after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">
        For any questions regarding these Terms of Use, please <a href="/contact" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-hover">contact us</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
